# Bookmarking a project from its Today entry lists it under Bookmarks in the Navigator, and choosing it there zooms the pane into it.
file <<END
Launch: @due({today})
	- Write post
	- Record demo
Home:
END
keys gt mb
status Bookmarked
keys <C-g>
see Bookmarks
type launch
keys <Enter>
see 󰋜 › Launch
keys j x
quit
saved <<END
Launch: @due({today}) @bookmark
	- Write post @done({today})
	- Record demo
Home:
END
